      "text": "## Synchronization: the Kuramoto Model"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-APPLICATIONS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "09-APPLICATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
