      "text": "How do fireflies flash in unison, power-grid generators stay in phase, or pacemaker cells fire\ntogether? Each is a **limit-cycle oscillator** (Ch. 04) reduced to its phase, weakly coupled to the\nothers. The Kuramoto model is the canonical reduction."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-APPLICATIONS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "09-APPLICATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:dynamical-systems:09-applications, git-history:dynamical-systems:09-applications]",
        "canonical_path": "dynamical-systems/09-APPLICATIONS.md",
