        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Applications",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "ORDER PARAMETER (mean field):  r e^{i psi} = (1/N) SUM_j e^{i theta_j}\n        r = 0 : phases scattered (incoherent)\n        r = 1 : all in phase (fully synchronized)"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-APPLICATIONS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "09-APPLICATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:dynamical-systems:09-applications, git-history:dynamical-systems:09-applications]",
