      "text": "r ^                       Below K_c: r = 0 (incoherent), the only\n     |               ____    stable state.\n     |            __/        At K_c = 2 / (pi g(0)): a SUPERCRITICAL\n     |          _/           PITCHFORK-like bifurcation (Ch. 03) -> a\n     |        _/             synchronized branch r > 0 appears and grows\n   0 +------+-----------> K  as r ~ sqrt(K - K_c).\n            K_c\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-APPLICATIONS.md#013",
      "path": [
        "09-APPLICATIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:dynamical-systems:09-applications, git-history:dynamical-systems:09-applications]",
        "canonical_path": "dynamical-systems/09-APPLICATIONS.md",
